{"id":"186442922","url":"https://www.xiaoheihe.cn/app/bbs/link/186442922","authorName":"猎杀每一个招娣","levelLabel":"Lv.5","publishTime":"昨天14:39","region":"黑龙江","fullTitle":"猫和老鼠这作画也太强了吧，就一帧的画面。","summary":"这个杰瑞被砍到的画面就一帧","bodyParagraphs":["这个杰瑞被砍到的画面就一帧","截图都得慢放来截图。","结果居然画的这么精致。","完全不输给现代的那些高质量动画。"],"circles":["动漫"],"images":["https://imgheybox1.max-c.com/bbs/2026/07/23/0c28fc3caf0b935212e531f02324ea45/thumb.jpeg","https://imgheybox1.max-c.com/oa/2024/08/02/49cb5ef5e55705e759efe11389a2bb8b.png"],"comments":[{"id":"c_186442922_0","authorName":"rajacakkavattin","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"r","levelLabel":"Lv.34","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":true,"timeText":"广东","region":"","content":"看这个图我第一反应竟然是杰瑞咬着舌头了不疼吗，然后意识到脑袋都被剁了我竟然还在担心咬舌头疼不疼","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":2121,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_0_r0","authorName":"Xmasjoker","isAuthor":false,"content":"因为大伙都知道刀砍不死杰瑞，但是咬到舌头是真的很痛","timeText":"昨天15:15","region":"四川","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_0_r1","authorName":"Summer_Eye","isAuthor":false,"content":"大伙没被刀砍过头，但是真咬到过舌头","timeText":"昨天15:34","region":"湖南","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_1","authorName":"曹县一中招生办","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"曹","levelLabel":"Lv.19","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":true,"timeText":"山东","region":"","content":"猫和老鼠的质量高的离谱即便是现在业界也没几个能做他的对手，我平板下了几百集没有就循环看百看不厌传世经典","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":1726,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_1_r0","authorName":"Loit","isAuthor":false,"content":"猫和老鼠好多版本，我只看中间那个最经典的版本好看，后面形象就变了感觉就一般了","timeText":"昨天15:24","region":"内蒙古","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_1_r1","authorName":"Kキウイ","isAuthor":false,"content":"最后是猫变成小圆脸那个是嘛","timeText":"昨天15:33","region":"天津","replyToName":"Loit"}]},{"id":"c_186442922_2","authorName":"(눈_눈)","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"(","levelLabel":"Lv.23","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":true,"timeText":"陕西","region":"","content":"不只作画，配乐和bgm全是管弦乐团演奏的","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":1083,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_2_r0","authorName":"西贝曌","isAuthor":false,"content":"确实，全是世界经典名曲","timeText":"昨天15:20","region":"辽宁","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_2_r1","authorName":"拉布拉多拉de多","isAuthor":false,"content":"不但用的是名曲，而且还和剧情搭配的很合理，符合情景","timeText":"昨天16:25","region":"河北","replyToName":"西贝曌"}]},{"id":"c_186442922_3","authorName":"杀手入侵","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"杀","levelLabel":"Lv.16","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"上海","region":"","content":"这种“烧钱”的做法带来了巨大的工作量——一部7分钟短片就需要约15000张手绘中间画，一集需要150人团队花费半年到18个月才能完成。\n正是这种对每一帧的极致追求，才成就了这部不朽的经典。","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":752,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_3_r0","authorName":"敢问上天是否有仙","isAuthor":false,"content":"平均一人100张，需要18个月？ 月均5张？","timeText":"昨天15:29","region":"山西","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_3_r1","authorName":"杀手入侵","isAuthor":false,"content":"内容来自dp","timeText":"昨天15:31","region":"上海","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_4","authorName":"NO.1","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"N","levelLabel":"Lv.25","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"黑龙江","region":"","content":"你要知道，这东西没台词 全靠画面动作还有嗷嗷嗷","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":545,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_4_r0","authorName":"ᐕ","isAuthor":false,"content":"汤姆的女主人不是说过话吗","timeText":"昨天15:32","region":"广东","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_4_r1","authorName":"天之崖","isAuthor":false,"content":"猫叫，嗷嗷嗷。。嗷嗷，抱脚","timeText":"昨天15:33","region":"河南","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_5","authorName":"疯狂的大老猫","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"疯","levelLabel":"Lv.8","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"河南","region":"","content":"假如我能看见风:\n昨天15:37·浙江","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":452,"replyTotal":1,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_5_r0","authorName":"玩家64641213","isAuthor":false,"content":"不削能玩？","timeText":"昨天15:43","region":"广东","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_6","authorName":"老李玩玩游戏","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"老","levelLabel":"Lv.16","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"江苏","region":"","content":"猫和老鼠的制作成本本来就很高，早期作品一年也就出一部，放在电影院贴片上映的，本来就是高规格制作，反而是后期制作水平肉眼可见的下滑严重","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":354,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_6_r0","authorName":"义合","isAuthor":false,"content":"跟日本动漫一样，黄金时期的产物，泡沫破裂后供不起了","timeText":"昨天16:23","region":"福建","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_6_r1","authorName":"ilililk23","isAuthor":false,"content":"日本动画反而是泡沫经济破裂后才引来高峰的","timeText":"昨天17:55","region":"广西","replyToName":"义合"}]},{"id":"c_186442922_7","authorName":"笑吟风","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"笑","levelLabel":"Lv.18","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"山东","region":"","content":"这还不是最震撼我的，最震撼我的是这片子是美国一边在外面打二战，一边国内制作的。足见当年的美国国力多强，当年真的是世界霸主，可惜现在拉成这样了","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":201,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_7_r0","authorName":"Assassins_Edward","isAuthor":false,"content":"不懂就问哪里拉了？","timeText":"昨天15:57","region":"广东","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_7_r1","authorName":"elysium","isAuthor":false,"content":"美国当年就没深度参战，反而获利啊","timeText":"昨天15:59","region":"福建","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_8","authorName":"萧玖K","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"萧","levelLabel":"Lv.25","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"广东","region":"","content":"制作这短短的一集动画花费的成本，在那个年代足够制作一集猫和老鼠了\nYy:\n昨天16:19·宁夏","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":143,"replyTotal":1,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_8_r0","authorName":"BSCkylin","isAuthor":false,"content":"原来如此","timeText":"昨天16:28","region":"上海","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_9","authorName":"capcum","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"c","levelLabel":"Lv.19","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"陕西","region":"","content":"大半个世纪前的东西现在看来依旧不过时那说明他是真有东西，我今年都31了，现在抖音刷到猫和老鼠还得硬控我几分钟，虽然都看过不知道多少次了","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":85,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_9_r0","authorName":"玩家97940347","isAuthor":false,"content":"看一眼就能想起来剧情，但就是挪不开眼","timeText":"昨天17:14","region":"安徽","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_9_r1","authorName":"李氏神魔恋","isAuthor":false,"content":"海绵宝宝，猫和老鼠现在看都不过实","timeText":"昨天17:25","region":"陕西","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_10","authorName":"陆常本茉","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"陆","levelLabel":"Lv.18","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"四川","region":"","content":"那就给你看一集，就一集！","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":72,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_10_r0","authorName":"玩家30115445","isAuthor":false,"content":"脑补出音效了","timeText":"昨天18:13","region":"陕西","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_10_r1","authorName":"阿祖今天也有好好生活","isAuthor":false,"content":"我chovy，压缩给我压缩好了啊","timeText":"昨天18:29","region":"四川","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_11","authorName":"零柒伍","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"零","levelLabel":"Lv.19","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"四川","region":"","content":"我一直觉得截止目前没有能超越猫和老鼠的动画，太nb了，所有的BGM以及全手绘，关键还是几十年前的出品","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":45,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_11_r0","authorName":"史蒂夫","isAuthor":false,"content":"同时代的迪士尼动画还是能超越的或者说能平起平坐","timeText":"10小时前","region":"福建","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_11_r1","authorName":"Tiall","isAuthor":false,"content":"那你看迪士尼的动画片更久还是看猫和老鼠更久","timeText":"6小时前","region":"湖北","replyToName":"史蒂夫"}]},{"id":"c_186442922_12","authorName":"先来K","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"先","levelLabel":"Lv.20","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"山东","region":"","content":"一集够柜子做一部异世界厕纸了","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":25,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_12_r0","authorName":"Nailuo.vi","isAuthor":false,"content":"厕纸没那么贵","timeText":"昨天18:25","region":"江西","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_12_r1","authorName":"柚子球","isAuthor":false,"content":"没那么贵，猫和老鼠折合现在等于一集近600W美元","timeText":"昨天19:48","region":"四川","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_13","authorName":"溜冰室主人","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"溜","levelLabel":"Lv.18","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"重庆","region":"","content":"？有没有一种可能，猫和老鼠的制作比几乎所有现代动画都豪华，光是音乐就拉爆现在的了","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":20,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]},{"id":"c_186442922_14","authorName":"Nailuo.vi","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"N","levelLabel":"Lv.19","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"江西","region":"","content":"论成本，猫和老鼠说是动漫届最高的山也不为过，汤姆有一集弹钢琴，据说是按照谱子的音节，一张一张画的，琴键和声音基本都对的上。剧情和配乐更是顶级水平，百看不腻","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":13,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_14_r0","authorName":"Skfnee","isAuthor":false,"content":"而且还是按照汤姆只有四个指头弹琴，还全部合理的对上了","timeText":"17小时前","region":"四川","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_14_r1","authorName":"影歌","isAuthor":false,"content":"《猫的协奏曲》，奥斯卡最佳动画短片奖","timeText":"3小时前","region":"天津","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_15","authorName":"涩涩乃第一生产力","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"涩","levelLabel":"Lv.17","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"浙江","region":"","content":"7届奥斯卡和你开玩笑呢","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":17,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]},{"id":"c_186442922_16","authorName":"梦醒时分","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"梦","levelLabel":"Lv.17","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"河北","region":"","content":"21世纪的3d动画作品领袖之证也有猫和老鼠这味道了，小时候天天在少儿频道中午的动漫世界看，现在长大了才知道那动画片一集居然这么贵，而且一集20多分钟片头片尾加起来不到3分钟，完全是实心的，除了有时候片头会有上一集的剧情回顾","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":7,"replyTotal":1,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_16_r0","authorName":"馬薙天愛星です","isAuthor":false,"content":"变形金刚那个动画我从头看到尾，真的好看","timeText":"昨天23:31","region":"四川","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_17","authorName":"誶皨","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"誶","levelLabel":"Lv.21","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"上海","region":"","content":"那就给你看一集","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":5,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_17_r0","authorName":"97XHHsmm","isAuthor":false,"content":"还要看","timeText":"6小时前","region":"江苏","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_17_r1","authorName":"lighadow","isAuthor":false,"content":"你又浪费了我10分钟","timeText":"2小时前","region":"广东","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_18","authorName":"在玩三国杀","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"在","levelLabel":"Lv.28","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"江苏","region":"","content":"在影视文娱行业能看到当年的美国确实强，在那个时代做到了现在看来都难达到的程度，然而再看现在的美国简直就是一坨","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":8,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_18_r0","authorName":"鬼泣咿呀忍龙搓啊","isAuthor":false,"content":"现在美国光顾着dei了，艺术创造首先是为了艺术和创造，而不是为了宣扬某种意识形态而把自己封死在某个框架里，就像绑着钢筋跳舞一样","timeText":"昨天16:18","region":"北京","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_18_r1","authorName":"玩家50371930","isAuthor":false,"content":"你别害我看不了黑盒","timeText":"昨天18:35","region":"四川","replyToName":"鬼泣咿呀忍龙搓啊"}]},{"id":"c_186442922_19","authorName":"灌水柠檬","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"灌","levelLabel":"Lv.21","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"山东","region":"","content":"纯手绘这一块","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":10,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]},{"id":"c_186442922_20","authorName":"吕崇哲y1","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"吕","levelLabel":"Lv.18","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"山东","region":"","content":"Ai","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":20,"replyTotal":2,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_20_r0","authorName":"云游嵯峨","isAuthor":false,"content":"串子","timeText":"昨天14:53","region":"安徽","replyToName":""},{"id":"c_186442922_20_r1","authorName":"MagicWolf2106","isAuthor":false,"content":"串的不像","timeText":"昨天14:55","region":"湖南","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_21","authorName":"Music鱼yu🐟","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"M","levelLabel":"Lv.17","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"安徽","region":"","content":"之前还看过猫和老鼠的初代美术画原神角色来着，只能说老资历虽然可能不知道现在的二次元流行什么，但是可能能给你画一个很板正的东西出来高手就是高手","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":4,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]},{"id":"c_186442922_22","authorName":"人类高质量ikun","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"人","levelLabel":"Lv.18","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"河南","region":"","content":"猫和老鼠没让我震惊，第一个让我震惊的动画是赛车总动员，零几年去电影院看的，路上的纹理、窗户上用汽车做的小苍蝇以及车胎上清晰的灰尘，那时候都觉得这技术力实在太牛逼了，当时我记得国内还在喜羊羊与灰太狼，还有什么红猫蓝兔啥的","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":0,"replyTotal":1,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_22_r0","authorName":"blackbox未来之星","isAuthor":false,"content":"老版3d迪士尼都很精美","timeText":"5小时前","region":"浙江","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_23","authorName":"玩家80425886","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"玩","levelLabel":"Lv.16","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"浙江","region":"","content":"猫鼠在动画业界评价也一直是顶级的，外行人只觉得他很厉害，是天花板。我专业做动画的朋友，业内搞了十几年，他跟我说猫鼠tmd是屋顶，天花板只是一极度谦虚的说法！只是按照现在的动画工业流程，这种水平的动画基本成为绝响了。","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":1,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]},{"id":"c_186442922_24","authorName":"柚子球","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"柚","levelLabel":"Lv.11","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"四川","region":"","content":"猫和老鼠我记得成本特别高，作为一个完全没有台词的动画，他的动画是一帧帧手画的，他的配乐是用交响乐一拍拍合并的，严丝合缝，那时候可没有AI纯手工制作拍了上百集\n人家拿那么多奖真的是该拿","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":2,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]},{"id":"c_186442922_25","authorName":"超级地球动漫部","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"超","levelLabel":"Lv.18","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"天津","region":"","content":"猫和老鼠的制作水平也就大友克洋时代能比一比了，都是砸钱跟泄洪一样的年代。现在日本人也没钱了，做动画的都舍不得砸钱了加之3d技术成熟，2d逐帧动画比起商用更适合当艺术品","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":1,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]},{"id":"c_186442922_26","authorName":"国考摸个鱼","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"国","levelLabel":"Lv.18","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"江苏","region":"","content":"因为那个时代动画都是逐帧手绘的，中间帧绘的故意绘画模糊简易来减少工作量，还能增加动态模糊。总体工作量巨大无比","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":3,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]},{"id":"c_186442922_27","authorName":"翊镜","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"翊","levelLabel":"Lv.15","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"江苏","region":"","content":"从小爸妈买的全套的碟片看的，到现在经常再去网上翻了看看还是很有意思，哪怕已经知道剧情会怎样发展，真的经典了只能说","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":1,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]},{"id":"c_186442922_28","authorName":"开罗压路机","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"开","levelLabel":"Lv.18","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"辽宁","region":"","content":"不如哪吒2\n查看更多回复","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":3,"replyTotal":1,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_28_r0","authorName":"苏离","isAuthor":false,"content":"不如三国杀太平天书","timeText":"昨天16:43","region":"湖南","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_29","authorName":"岩与露","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"岩","levelLabel":"Lv.18","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"河南","region":"","content":"1940—1957，这段时间的猫和老鼠一集制作成本在5w美元左右，而当时一辆最新款汽车才1500美元。\n按照黄金来算，当时5w美元的黄金现在价值350w美元，也就是说一集成本在350w美元左右，制作精良可想而知。","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":0,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]},{"id":"c_186442922_30","authorName":"玩家68244048","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"玩","levelLabel":"Lv.16","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"广东","region":"","content":"猫和老鼠对我来说是艺术品，我觉得不需要台词，闭上眼睛甚至能听配乐听出剧情发展，表情丰富，表达能力强，又有教育意义，真是老少皆宜","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":0,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]},{"id":"c_186442922_31","authorName":"群山涌动的编织者","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"群","levelLabel":"Lv.20","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"福建","region":"","content":"当年猫和老鼠是上院线的，大伙花半张电影票钱来看10分钟不到的动画片，没点真东西留不住人的。1940-1960年共二十届奥斯卡最佳动画短片迪士尼占11席，米高梅占7席","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":0,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]},{"id":"c_186442922_32","authorName":"千梦雨霖","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"千","levelLabel":"Lv.30","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"安徽","region":"","content":"猫和老鼠的投入放在现在属于超高离谱的规格，资本都不敢投的那种","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":1,"replyTotal":1,"replies":[{"id":"c_186442922_32_r0","authorName":"千梦雨霖","isAuthor":false,"content":"作为一个在比谁更优秀更进步的时代胜出的作品，基本上已经达到创作的巅峰了，我们现在这种比烂时代已经不太可能出现这种水平的创作了","timeText":"6小时前","region":"安徽","replyToName":""}]},{"id":"c_186442922_33","authorName":"沫沫120","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"沫","levelLabel":"Lv.13","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"山东","region":"","content":"周知杰瑞不怕刀","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":0,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]},{"id":"c_186442922_34","authorName":"玩家56929269","authorAvatarColor":"","authorAvatarText":"玩","levelLabel":"Lv.18","isAuthor":false,"isOfficial":false,"isPinned":false,"timeText":"湖南","region":"","content":"这动画的制作周期很长的，汤姆谈钢琴那集的制作周期好像是一年半来着","imageKey":"","imageColor":"","likeCount":0,"replyTotal":0,"replies":[]}],"commentCount":276,"likeCount":1279,"starCount":187,"awardCount":0}